{"id": "r01_40", "text": "Hi there! Hope your day is going well. So, what I need is for you to put the blue objects in the center bin. The yellow ones should go in the left bin. And the red ones, well, those go in the right bin. Thanks a million!", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "chatty", "adversarial": false}
