{"id": "r01_57", "text": "Everything goes into the left bin, except the cylinders, which go into the right bin, except the yellow cylinder, which goes in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "adv_nested_exception", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r01_58", "text": "Don't put the red objects in the left bin or the center bin; they belong in the right bin. The yellow objects, on the other hand, do go in the left bin, and the blue ones stay put.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "adv_negation_scope", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r01_59", "text": "I left the blue pieces out of the last batch, so they need sorting now. Put them in the right bin. The red ones go wherever the blue ones are going, and the yellow ones are fine where they are.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_pronoun", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r01_60", "text": "Right, let's start. The bin on the left stays empty today. Yellow objects go to the bin that's neither on the left nor on the right, and everything else goes in the right one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "adv_interjection_negation", "adversarial": true}
